{"pageProps": {"params": {"versionId": "59", "usfm": "JOB.31.ESV"}, "audioVersionInfo": {"title": "ESV Hear the Word Audio Bible", "copyright_long": {"text": "English: ESV Audio Old and New Testament", "html": "English: ESV Audio Old and New Testament"}, "copyright_short": {"text": "\u2117 2016 Crossway", "html": "<p>\u2117 2016 Crossway</p>"}, "version_id": 59, "id": 1, "publisher_link": "", "dramatized": false, "publisher": {"id": 575, "name": "Hear Book Audio", "local_name": "Hear Book Audio", "url": null, "description": null}}, "type": "chapter", "chapterInfo": {"audioChapterInfo": [{"download_urls": {"format_mp3_32k": "//audio-bible-cdn.youversionapi.com/1/32k/JOB/31-834816b0b370bb4f0eec8b8a54ee1e9d.mp3?version_id=59", "format_hls": "//audio-hls.youversionapi.com/1/m4a/32k/JOB/31-834816b0b370bb4f0eec8b8a54ee1e9d.m3u8?version_id=59"}, "id": 1, "version_id": 59, "title": "ESV Hear the Word Audio Bible", "timing_available": true, "dramatized": false, "default": true}], "content": "<div class=\"version vid59 iso6393eng\" data-vid=\"59\" data-iso6393=\"eng\">\n    <div class=\"book bkJOB\">\n        <div class=\"chapter ch31\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31\">\n            <div class=\"label\">31</div><div class=\"s1\"><span class=\"heading\">Job&#8217;s Final Appeal</span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"verse v1\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.1\"><span class=\"label\">1</span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;I have made a covenant with my </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Isa. 33:15; Matt. 5:28]</span></span><span class=\"content\">eyes;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v1\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.1\"><span class=\"content\">how then could I gaze at a virgin?</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v1\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.1\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.2\"><span class=\"label\">2</span><span class=\"content\">What would be </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 20:29</span></span><span class=\"content\">my portion from God above</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.2\"><span class=\"content\">and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 20:29</span></span><span class=\"content\">my heritage from the Almighty on high?</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.2\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.3\"><span class=\"label\">3</span><span class=\"content\">Is not calamity for the unrighteous,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.3\"><span class=\"content\">and disaster for the workers of iniquity?</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.3\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.4\"><span class=\"label\">4</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    ch. 14:16; 34:21; 2 Chr. 16:9; Prov. 5:21; 15:3; Jer. 16:17; 32:19; Zech. 4:10   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Does not he see my ways</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.4\"><span class=\"content\">and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 14:16</span></span><span class=\"content\">number all my steps?</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.4\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.5\"><span class=\"label\">5</span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;If I have walked with falsehood</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.5\"><span class=\"content\">and my foot has hastened to deceit;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.5\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.6\"><span class=\"label\">6</span><span class=\"content\">(Let me be </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Dan. 5:27</span></span><span class=\"content\">weighed in a just balance,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.6\"><span class=\"content\">and let God know my integrity!)</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.6\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.7\"><span class=\"label\">7</span><span class=\"content\">if my step has turned aside from the way</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.7\"><span class=\"content\">and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Num. 15:39; Eccles. 11:9 </span></span><span class=\"content\">my heart has gone after my eyes,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.7\"><span class=\"content\">and if any </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 11:15]</span></span><span class=\"content\">spot has stuck to my hands,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.7\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.8\"><span class=\"label\">8</span><span class=\"content\">then let me </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Lev. 26:16; Deut. 28:30, 38; [John 4:37]</span></span><span class=\"content\">sow, and another eat,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.8\"><span class=\"content\">and let what grows for me</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">31:8 </span><span class=\"ft\">Or </span><span class=\"fq\">let my descendants</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> be rooted out.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.8\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.9\"><span class=\"label\">9</span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;If my heart has been enticed toward a woman,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.9\"><span class=\"content\">and I have </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 24:15]</span></span><span class=\"content\">lain in wait at my neighbor&#8217;s door,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.9\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.10\"><span class=\"label\">10</span><span class=\"content\">then let my wife </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Ex. 11:5; Isa. 47:2] </span></span><span class=\"content\">grind for another,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.10\"><span class=\"content\">and let others </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[2 Sam. 12:11; Jer. 8:10]</span></span><span class=\"content\">bow down on her.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.10\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.11\"><span class=\"label\">11</span><span class=\"content\">For that would be a heinous crime;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.11\"><span class=\"content\">that would be an iniquity </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ver. 28; [Lev. 20:10; Deut. 22:22]</span></span><span class=\"content\">to be punished by the judges;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.11\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.12\"><span class=\"label\">12</span><span class=\"content\">for that would be a fire </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Prov. 6:27-29</span></span><span class=\"content\">that consumes as far as Abaddon,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.12\"><span class=\"content\">and it would burn to the root all my increase.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.12\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.13\"><span class=\"label\">13</span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;If I have rejected the cause of my manservant or my maidservant,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.13\"><span class=\"content\">when they brought a complaint against me,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.13\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.14\"><span class=\"label\">14</span><span class=\"content\">what then shall I do when God rises up?</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.14\"><span class=\"content\">When he </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 17:3</span></span><span class=\"content\">makes inquiry, what shall I answer him?</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.14\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.15\"><span class=\"label\">15</span><span class=\"content\">Did </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 34:19; Prov. 14:31; 22:2; [Eph. 6:9]</span></span><span class=\"content\">not he who made me in the womb make him?</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.15\"><span class=\"content\">And did not one fashion us in the womb?</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.15\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.16\"><span class=\"label\">16</span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;If I have </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 22:7] </span></span><span class=\"content\">withheld anything that the poor desired,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.16\"><span class=\"content\">or have </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 11:20; 17:5</span></span><span class=\"content\">caused the eyes of the widow to fail,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.16\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.17\"><span class=\"label\">17</span><span class=\"content\">or have eaten my morsel alone,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.17\"><span class=\"content\">and the fatherless has not eaten of it</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.17\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v18\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.18\"><span class=\"label\">18</span><span class=\"content\">(for from my youth the fatherless</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">31:18 </span><span class=\"ft\">Hebrew </span><span class=\"fq\">he</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> grew up with me as with a father,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v18\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.18\"><span class=\"content\">and from my mother&#8217;s womb I guided the widow</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">31:18 </span><span class=\"ft\">Hebrew </span><span class=\"fq\">her</span></span></span><span class=\"content\">),</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v18\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.18\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v19\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.19\"><span class=\"label\">19</span><span class=\"content\">if I have seen anyone </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 29:13 </span></span><span class=\"content\">perish for </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 24:7, 10</span></span><span class=\"content\">lack of clothing,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v19\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.19\"><span class=\"content\">or the needy without </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 24:7, 10</span></span><span class=\"content\">covering,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v19\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.19\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v20\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.20\"><span class=\"label\">20</span><span class=\"content\">if his body has not </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 29:13; Deut. 24:13</span></span><span class=\"content\">blessed me,</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">31:20 </span><span class=\"ft\">Hebrew </span><span class=\"fq\">if his loins have not blessed me</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v20\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.20\"><span class=\"content\">and if he was not warmed with the fleece of my sheep,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v20\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.20\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v21\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.21\"><span class=\"label\">21</span><span class=\"content\">if I have raised my hand against </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 22:9 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the fatherless,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v21\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.21\"><span class=\"content\">because I saw my help in </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 5:4</span></span><span class=\"content\">the gate,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v21\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.21\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v22\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.22\"><span class=\"label\">22</span><span class=\"content\">then let my shoulder blade fall from my shoulder,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v22\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.22\"><span class=\"content\">and let my arm be broken from its socket.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v22\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.22\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v23\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.23\"><span class=\"label\">23</span><span class=\"content\">For I was </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 13:11</span></span><span class=\"content\">in terror of calamity from God,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v23\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.23\"><span class=\"content\">and I could not have faced his </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 13:11</span></span><span class=\"content\">majesty.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v23\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.23\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v24\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.24\"><span class=\"label\">24</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Mark 10:24, 25   </span></span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;If I have made gold my </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 4:6 </span></span><span class=\"content\">trust</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v24\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.24\"><span class=\"content\">or called </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 28:16</span></span><span class=\"content\">fine gold my confidence,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v24\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.24\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v25\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.25\"><span class=\"label\">25</span><span class=\"content\">if I have </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 62:10 </span></span><span class=\"content\">rejoiced because my wealth was abundant</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v25\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.25\"><span class=\"content\">or because </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Deut. 8:17</span></span><span class=\"content\">my hand had found much,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v25\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.25\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v26\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.26\"><span class=\"label\">26</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Deut. 4:19; [Deut. 17:3; 2 Kgs. 23:5, 11; Ezek. 8:16]   </span></span><span class=\"content\">if I have looked at the sun</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">31:26 </span><span class=\"ft\">Hebrew </span><span class=\"fq\">the light</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> when it shone,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v26\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.26\"><span class=\"content\">or </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Jer. 44:17-19</span></span><span class=\"content\">the moon moving in splendor,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v26\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.26\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v27\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.27\"><span class=\"label\">27</span><span class=\"content\">and my heart has been secretly enticed,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v27\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.27\"><span class=\"content\">and my mouth has kissed my hand,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v27\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.27\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v28\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.28\"><span class=\"label\">28</span><span class=\"content\">this also would be </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ver. 11</span></span><span class=\"content\">an iniquity to be punished by the judges,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v28\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.28\"><span class=\"content\">for I would have been false to God above.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v28\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.28\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v29\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.29\"><span class=\"label\">29</span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;If I have </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Prov. 17:5</span></span><span class=\"content\">rejoiced at the ruin of him who hated me,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v29\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.29\"><span class=\"content\">or exulted when evil overtook him</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v29\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.29\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v30\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.30\"><span class=\"label\">30</span><span class=\"content\">(</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Matt. 5:44; Rom. 12:14]</span></span><span class=\"content\">I have not let my mouth sin</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v30\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.30\"><span class=\"content\">by asking for his life with a curse),</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v30\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.30\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v31\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.31\"><span class=\"label\">31</span><span class=\"content\">if the men of my tent have not said,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v31\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.31\"><span class=\"content\">&#8216;Who is there that has not been filled with his </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ex. 16:12; 1 Sam. 25:11</span></span><span class=\"content\">meat?&#8217;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v31\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.31\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v32\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.32\"><span class=\"label\">32</span><span class=\"content\">(</span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Gen. 19:2, 3; Judg. 19:20, 21; Matt. 25:35; Heb. 13:2]</span></span><span class=\"content\">the sojourner has not lodged in the street;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v32\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.32\"><span class=\"content\">I have opened my doors to the traveler),</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v32\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.32\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v33\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.33\"><span class=\"label\">33</span><span class=\"content\">if I </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Prov. 28:13 </span></span><span class=\"content\">have concealed my transgressions </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Gen. 3:8, 12</span></span><span class=\"content\">as others do</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">31:33 </span><span class=\"ft\">Or </span><span class=\"fq\">as Adam did</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v33\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.33\"><span class=\"content\">by hiding my iniquity in my heart,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v33\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.33\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v34\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.34\"><span class=\"label\">34</span><span class=\"content\">because I stood in great fear of </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Ex. 23:2]</span></span><span class=\"content\">the multitude,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v34\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.34\"><span class=\"content\">and the contempt of families terrified me,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v34\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.34\"><span class=\"content\">so that I kept silence, and did not go out of doors&#8212;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v34\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.34\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v35\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.35\"><span class=\"label\">35</span><span class=\"content\">Oh, that I had one to hear me!</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v35\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.35\"><span class=\"content\">(Here is my signature! Let the Almighty </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 13:22 </span></span><span class=\"content\">answer me!)</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v35\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.35\"><span class=\"content\">Oh, that I had </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 19:23]</span></span><span class=\"content\">the indictment written by my adversary!</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v35\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.35\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v36\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.36\"><span class=\"label\">36</span><span class=\"content\">Surely I would carry it on my </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Isa. 9:6; 22:22 </span></span><span class=\"content\">shoulder;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v36\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.36\"><span class=\"content\">I would </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Prov. 6:21 </span></span><span class=\"content\">bind it on me as </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Zech. 6:11</span></span><span class=\"content\">a crown;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v36\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.36\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v37\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.37\"><span class=\"label\">37</span><span class=\"content\">I would give him an account of all my steps;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v37\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.37\"><span class=\"content\">like a prince I would approach him.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v37\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.37\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v38\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.38\"><span class=\"label\">38</span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;If my land has cried out against me</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v38\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.38\"><span class=\"content\">and its furrows have wept together,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v38\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.38\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v39\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.39\"><span class=\"label\">39</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [ch. 22:6-9; Luke 10:7; 2 Tim. 2:6; James 5:4]   </span></span><span class=\"content\">if I have eaten its yield without payment</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v39\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.39\"><span class=\"content\">and made its owners </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[1 Kgs. 21:16, 19]</span></span><span class=\"content\">breathe their last,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v39\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.39\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v40\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.40\"><span class=\"label\">40</span><span class=\"content\">let </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Gen. 3:18</span></span><span class=\"content\">thorns grow instead of wheat,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v40\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.40\"><span class=\"content\">and foul weeds instead of barley.&#8221;</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"verse v40\" data-usfm=\"JOB.31.40\"><span class=\"content\">The words of Job are ended.</span></span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>", "copyright": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers.</p>", "text": "The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers."}, "next": {"canonical": true, "usfm": ["JOB.32"], "human": "Job 32", "toc": true, "version_id": 59}, "previous": {"canonical": true, "usfm": ["JOB.30"], "human": "Job 30", "toc": true, "version_id": 59}, "reference": {"usfm": ["JOB.31"], "human": "Job 31", "version_id": 59}}, "usfm": "JOB.31.ESV", "locale": "en", "versionData": {"audio": true, "copyright_short": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 200